<title>FRANCE: Rouen June 1-4 wheat exports at 85,198 T.</title>
<headline>Rouen June 1-4 wheat exports at 85,198 T.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-06-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Wheat exports from Rouen reached 85,198 tonnes between June 1 and June 4, port officials said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>Total grain exports were 181,000 tonnes for the whole of June 1996.</p>
<p>Officials gave the following breakdown by destination (in tonnes).</p>
<p>WHEAT</p>
<p>    West Africa		    8,500</p>
<p>    Algeria			 23,243</p>
<p>    Chile			    4,140</p>
<p>    Cuba			    21,994</p>
<p>    Britain			  3,321</p>
<p>    Iraq			    24,000</p>
<p>-- Paris newsroom +331 4221 5432</p>
</text>
